{"appid": 2784470, "gama": {"steamId": 2784470, "id": 2784470, "name": "9 Kings", "copiesSold": 1127310, "unreleased": false, "earlyAccess": true, "firstReleaseDate": 1747958400000, "releaseDate": 1747958400000, "EAReleaseDate": 1747958400000, "price": 19.99, "developers": ["Sad Socket"], "publishers": ["Hooded Horse", "Sidekick Publishing"], "publisherClass": "AA", "reviewScore": 92, "genres": ["RPG", "Strategy", "Early Access"], "tags": ["Strategy", "RPG", "Auto Battler", "Roguelike", "Card Game", "Deckbuilding", "Roguelike Deckbuilder", "Multiplayer", "Roguelite", "Turn-Based Combat", "Card Battler", "Difficult", "2D", "Indie", "Singleplayer", "Replay Value", "Fantasy", "Dungeon Crawler", "Procedural Generation", "Early Access"]}, "store": {"type": "game", "name": "九王 9 Kings", "steam_appid": 2784470, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >想了解《九王》以及更多 Hooded Horse 策略类游戏信息与福利，QQ频道搜索:Hooded Horse 加入我们 或关注 bilibili 官方账号 @HoodedHorse。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2784470/extras/6688235669845ac3bf3d71322f8263a6.poster.avif?t=1791487349\" width=780 height=362 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2784470/extras/6688235669845ac3bf3d71322f8263a6.webm?t=1791487349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2784470/extras/6688235669845ac3bf3d71322f8263a6.mp4?t=1791487349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >巧妙打造你的初始城邦，开启无限策略组合，整合建筑、部队、法术和布局威力，构筑恢宏强大王国。灵活运用高能战术，打破固有游戏规则，成就无人能敌巅峰势力。无论单人还是异步多人模式，皆可战略规划王国发展路径，应对连番独特挑战，见证不朽王国恒久屹立。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2784470/extras/a718ffa343ef171fce221564ce5793eb.avif?t=1791487349\" width=1560 height=134 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2784470/extras/30037cfc1b5eefe8656dad84b131e386.poster.avif?t=1791487349\" width=780 height=362 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2784470/extras/30037cfc1b5eefe8656dad84b131e386.webm?t=1791487349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2784470/extras/30037cfc1b5eefe8656dad84b131e386.mp4?t=1791487349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >城池起步于简陋村落，逐步筑成坚固堡垒。王国不断召集各式精锐作战单位，持续提升战斗实力。策略推进国土稳健扩张，建起抗衡岁月与战火的坚实疆域。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2784470/extras/7271a2ade05827a5234ca9cecaa041d3.avif?t=1791487349\" width=1560 height=134 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2784470/extras/1f53a6060c7fdb20c84f7bc04135fbba.poster.avif?t=1791487349\" width=780 height=362 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2784470/extras/1f53a6060c7fdb20c84f7bc04135fbba.webm?t=1791487349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2784470/extras/1f53a6060c7fdb20c84f7bc04135fbba.mp4?t=1791487349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >汇聚多样作战单位：强悍的骑士与术士，高伤低防的法师与投弹手，邪恶的小鬼军团与古灵精怪的蘑菇，全都听你号令，冲锋陷阵。积蓄金币招募庞大雇佣兵为你而战，施展黑暗魔法唤醒亡者重返沙场，驾驭自然之力横扫敌军！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2784470/extras/214a7c70a65952e19c55979917c2629c.avif?t=1791487349\" width=1560 height=134 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2784470/extras/988ab1661cb7ea424fdf44f0a89fb52d.poster.avif?t=1791487349\" width=780 height=362 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2784470/extras/988ab1661cb7ea424fdf44f0a89fb52d.webm?t=1791487349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2784470/extras/988ab1661cb7ea424fdf44f0a89fb52d.mp4?t=1791487349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >每位国王各自掌控不同的初始卡组，涵盖建筑、部队与法术体系。当敌王来犯，你可夺其专属卡牌为己所用。与战术风格不合的国王缔结和平，向拥有你心仪力量的国王果断宣战。运用从敌方夺取的战术资源，解锁各种独特增益效果，锻造所向披靡的终极军力。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2784470/extras/3a661f5fd62d8d08b8416c0ada36c4da.avif?t=1791487349\" width=1560 height=134 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >异步多人模式：与八位敌王一决高下，争夺最终屹立不倒的王国荣耀。一路冲击排位，成为名副其实的众王之王。更有外观自定义：以每日挑战及荣耀奖章解锁奖励，随心打造你的专属王国。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >任务模式：挑战各种颠覆常规的独特机制。踏遍已知世界，迎战各路君王，夺取至高王权。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >无尽模式：选择一位国王，迎击敌方诸王及其麾下精锐战士的狂潮攻势，而你的王国能够屹立多久？</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >尽情搭配卡牌组合，挑战策略建造极限。召唤千军万马为王座而战，在重重强敌中奋力求生，甚至打破游戏边界，一举击溃所有对手。</p>", "about_